<title>ITALY: Bank Italy changes res req'ment rule from Oct 21.</title>
<headline>Bank Italy changes res req'ment rule from Oct 21.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Band of Italy said on Friday it would raise to 12.5 percent from 10 percent the portion of the banks' minimum reserve requirement that can be mobilised on the interbank market with effect from Monday October 21.</p>
<p>The minimum reserve requirement for banks currently stands at 15 percent.</p>
<p>Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
</text>
